	<section_number>38.2-4605</section_number>
	<catch_line>Interim binders</catch_line>
	<text>
		Binders or other temporary insurance contracts may be made and used pending the issuance of a title insurance policy.
	</text>
	<history>1952, c. 317, § 38.1-725; 1986, c. 562.</history>
